@startuml
title T1 - DispatchTask state machine (BR-M4-08)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty description
[*] --> Recommended : plan created
Recommended --> Approved : approve [conditions valid, holds committed]
Recommended --> Rejected : reject
Recommended --> Failed : approve [conditions changed or hold conflict]
Recommended --> Cancelled : re-plan withdraws it (superseded)
Approved --> InProgress : pick-up confirmed
Approved --> Cancelled : operator cancels / release holds
Approved --> Failed : timeout before pick-up / release holds
InProgress --> Completed : return confirmed at destination
InProgress --> Cancelled : operator cancels / release holds
InProgress --> Failed : vehicle missing or faulty, or timeout / release holds
Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
@enduml
